        "TileImage": "$($repository ee7b20bb-b52f-4884-a375-7c05a5b7a601).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings, 47.\r\rYour targets are Erik Olander, Swedish Consul in Marrakesh, and Hilda Berg, his former head of security. Intelligence confirms both have embezzled diplomatic funds to finance extremist cells across North Africa—fueling regional instability and civilian casualties. Both are currently in Marrakesh, keeping in touch cellularly. They believe diplomatic immunity protects them. Make sure that won&apos;t be the case.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
